{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19168","headline":"和乐天耳顺吟兼寄敦诗 · 刘禹锡","name":"和乐天耳顺吟兼寄敦诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吟君新什慰蹉跎，屈指同登耳顺科。\n邓禹功成三纪事，孔融书就八年多。\n已经将相谁能尔，抛却丞郎争奈何。\n独恨长洲数千里，且随鱼鸟泛烟波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19168.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19168","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}